  "body_html": "<h1>monotonic_zProfile</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem monotonic_zProfile [Fintype N] [Fintype A] (f : VotingRule N A) (hM : Monotonicity f) (P Q : Profile N A) (R : Set A) [∀ a : A, Decidable (a ∈ R)] {a : A} (haR : a ∈ R) (ha : a ∈ f P) : a ∈ f (zProfile P Q R)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VotingRule</li>\n<li>Monotonicity</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>zProfile_prefers_inside</li>\n<li>zProfile_prefers_inside_outside</li>\n<li>StrictlyPreferred.asymm</li>\n<li>BallotPrefers.asymm</li>\n<li>Prefers.asymm</li>\n<li>Prefers</li>\n</ul>",
